  "body": "Apartment 209 in The Pines offers modern style and unbeatable convenience. Enjoy open plan living flowing to a sunny, covered deck—perfect for morning coffee or evening entertaining. Two bedrooms are positioned for privacy, one with direct deck access.\r\n\r\nHighlights:\r\n\r\n• Double glazing, insulation & heat pump\r\n• Modern kitchen with dishwasher\r\n• Secure basement car park and storage locker\r\n• Lift access, sprinkler system & smoke alarms\r\n• Walk to beach, shops, cafés & eateries, library & public transport\r\n\r\nEnjoy an easy lifestyle just steps from Browns Bay’s vibrant village and beach, with excellent transport links, Massey University nearby, and quality school zoning. Ideal as a first home, lock-up-and-leave, or smart investment.\r\n\r\nPlease get in touch to book an appointment to view.\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
